    <briefdescription>
<para>Snapshot of adapter state captured before a merge operation begins. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The snapshot is lightweight — it stores metadata only, not weight tensors. Recovery from a merge fault restores the adapter identity so the caller can reload from a verified checkpoint rather than using a partial result. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
